      "observations": [
        "Ios platformStorageModule binds a singleton real IosSecureKeyValueBacking through PlatformKeyedSecureStorage; P2pTransportModule consumes that SecureStorage binding.",
        "Home starts local and multiplayer probes concurrently. The multiplayer lookup does not require opening a physical room first.",
        "SecItemCopyMatching errSecItemNotFound alone yields null; errSecSuccess requires correctly typed and bounded CFData; every other status throws a generic non-secret error. CF ownership is released in finally.",
        "PlatformKeyedSecureStorage preserves CancellationException and maps other exceptions to secure_storage_io. Credential store maps that to Unavailable; RoomTransport maps it to NetError.SecureStorageUnavailable. Home sets hasUnavailableSource rather than treating it as a healthy empty store.",
        "Credential queries bind generic-password class, service/account, synchronizable=false; read asks for data/limit-one. No explicit access-group key is supplied.",
        "Put tries update, adds only on not-found, and retries update once after duplicate-add. Max backing bytes=16384; max serialized credential record=8192. Serialized transactions retain active and pending generations."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "An unavailable warning is not evidence of an app exception or crash.",
        "Production errors intentionally omit numeric OSStatus. A future instrumented invocation can supply its own bounded attributed status only.",
        "This read-only receipt does not establish the error from the historical original Home invocation or diagnose the reported first-four-launch crashes."
      ]
    },
